{"Title":"An Act designating a portion of state highway route 28 in the town of Harwich as the Alphonso Palmer Rogers highway","BillNumber":"H3838","DocketNumber":"HD4213","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-13T11:51:00.163"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-13T11:51:00.1633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3838/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peake of Provincetown, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Sarah K. Peake for legislation to designate a portion of state highway Route 28 in the town of Harwich as the Alphonso Palmer Rogers highway.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  The portion of state highway route 28 in the town of Harwich from the Dennis town line to the Chatham town line shall be designated and known as the Alphonso Palmer Rogers Highway, in honor of EM1 Alphonso Palmer Rogers, a two-time Purple Heart recipient for his service in the United States Navy during the 2nd World War in the Pacific Theatre.  The Massachusetts Department of Transportation is hereby directed to erect suitable markers along said highway bearing said designation in accordance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}